ty 300 player game exploiting your lack of anticheat\nand helping players, i don't suggest banning me, because i will just release the \nplaybook against your game's core concept open source for all to use.\n\n-irib\nchoco owner\n\nchoco may/may not get a script for this game.\nfuck marceloint. releasing this for anyone to use w/o a license.]]","owner":{"_id":"69d32101e687a39fc0b4e16c","username":"lostinthought","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/997a80149e8e914631f7b6a4a7cab5185bd8e2e9472a0cd90cb5586862bae3c2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69d32101e687a39fc0b4e16c-1784717441075.png"},"status":"offline","id":"69d32101e687a39fc0b4e16c","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.first_script","tier":1},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/997a80149e8e914631f7b6a4a7cab5185bd8e2e9472a0cd90cb5586862bae3c2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/69d32101e687a39fc0b4e16c-1784717441075.png"}},"verified":false,"views":1885,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9c67a822344a5e34c86ed4dd80539dc3cae41f5ac2620ed6f4f9bf9da72f03eb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fda08689535eb6bf0fb1ff73571aa02c-82c6fb8aa538.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fda08689535eb6bf0fb1ff73571aa02c-82c6fb8aa538.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-07-04T12:36:52.168Z","executes":384,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T01:02:36.035Z"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9c67a822344a5e34c86ed4dd80539dc3cae41f5ac2620ed6f4f9bf9da72f03eb.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-fda08689535eb6bf0fb1ff73571aa02c-82c6fb8aa538.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/rbx-fda08689535eb6bf0fb1ff73